Cell["\<\
All four identities hold \[LongDash] xAct proves this using only the symmetry \
of $H_{ab}$ and the algebraic structure of the Gauss equation, with no \
reference to dimension. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ae878a2f-73b8-4b57-92c2-30243df7c45f"],

